  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine black beans, pinto beans, papaya, water, 1/2 cup red onion, orange juice, green onions, green chiles, salsa, Cajun seasoning, Italian seasoning, garlic powder, and orange zest in a pot over medium heat; heat to almost boiling. Reduce heat and simmer for 10 to 15 minutes.",
